---
import AppLayout from '../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---

<AppLayout title="Wind & Hybrid Energy Solutions for C&I | OnLoop Energy" description="Explore OnLoop Energy's captive wind and hybrid power solutions engineered exclusively for commercial, industrial, and MSME facilities across India.">
<div>

  {/* Hero Section */}
  <section class="hero hero--short">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero__content">
        <div class="hero__badge" style="margin-top: var(--space-12);">
          <span class="hero__badge-dot"></span>
          Core Energy Architecture
        </div>
        <h1 class="hero__title">
          Wind & Hybrid Energy Solutions<br />
          <span class="hero__title-highlight">Engineered for C&I and MSMEs Across India.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__subtitle">We focus exclusively on two high-performance captive technologies: pure wind turbines and hybrid wind-solar architectures. Zero residential, zero tenders — just site-specific engineering.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Exclusion Banner */}
  <div style="background: rgba(31, 183, 166, 0.08); border-top: 1px solid rgba(31, 183, 166, 0.2); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(31, 183, 166, 0.2); padding: var(--space-4) 0;">
    <div class="container" style="text-align: center;">
      <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--font-size-base); color: var(--color-text-primary);">
        <strong>Exclusively Private B2B:</strong> Commercial, Industrial & MSME only. No residential. No government tenders.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Section 1: Technology Cards (Gateway to Wind & Hybrid) */}
  <section class="content-section fade-in" style="padding: var(--space-12) 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-section__header" style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: var(--space-8);">
        <span class="content-section__label">Our Technologies</span>
        <h2 class="content-section__title">Choose the Right Architecture for Your Factory</h2>
        <p class="content-section__text">Every manufacturing facility has a distinct load curve. Select a technology to explore detailed engineering specifications.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-2" style="gap: var(--space-8);">
        {/* Card 1: Wind Energy */}
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-8); background: #ffffff; border-top: 5px solid var(--color-primary); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">💨</div>
            <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">Captive Wind Energy Systems</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
              High-yield direct-drive wind turbines engineered for continuous 24/7 power generation. Ideal for multi-shift continuous process plants operating night shifts and monsoons when solar generation drops.
            </p>
            <ul style="margin: 0 0 var(--space-6) 0; padding-left: 20px; color: var(--color-text-primary); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8;">
              <li><strong>24/7 Power Output:</strong> Offsets high night-shift grid electricity tariffs.</li>
              <li><strong>Monsoon Peak Generation:</strong> Strongest wind yields coincide with monsoon season.</li>
              <li><strong>Perimeter Installation:</strong> Zero interference with factory roof space.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <a href="/wind" class="btn btn--primary btn--large" style="width: 100%; justify-content: center;">
            Explore Captive Wind Technology →
          </a>
        </div>

        {/* Card 2: Hybrid Systems */}
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-8); background: #ffffff; border-top: 5px solid var(--color-primary); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">⚡</div>
            <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">Hybrid Energy Systems (Wind + Solar)</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
              Unified generation architecture merging daytime solar output with round-the-clock wind power. Maximizes Capacity Utilization Factor (CUF) to over 35% with flat, predictable power delivery.
            </p>
            <ul style="margin: 0 0 var(--space-6) 0; padding-left: 20px; color: var(--color-text-primary); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8;">
              <li><strong>High Offset Potential:</strong> Offsets 70% – 75% of your total monthly utility bill.</li>
              <li><strong>Diurnal Flattening:</strong> Solar handles afternoon peaks; wind powers evening loads.</li>
              <li><strong>Shaves Peak MD Charges:</strong> Protects plant from high grid demand penalties.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <a href="/hybrid" class="btn btn--primary btn--large" style="width: 100%; justify-content: center;">
            Explore Hybrid Systems Technology →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Section 2: 3-Step Simple Process */}
  <section class="content-section fade-in" style="background: var(--color-bg-secondary); padding: var(--space-12) 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-section__header">
        <span class="content-section__label">Simple Implementation</span>
        <h2 class="content-section__title">How We Engineer Your Captive Plant</h2>
        <p class="content-section__text">From electricity bill analysis to commercial COD — zero friction.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3" style="gap: var(--space-6);">
        <div class="card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-6); position: relative;">
          <div style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-primary); position: absolute; top: 16px; right: 20px;">01</div>
          <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">📊</div>
          <h4 class="card__title" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">1. Bill & Tariff Analysis</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">
            We evaluate your monthly utility bills, tariff category, TOD rates, and peak demand (MD) charges.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-6); position: relative;">
          <div style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-primary); position: absolute; top: 16px; right: 20px;">02</div>
          <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">📐</div>
          <h4 class="card__title" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">2. Load & Resource Matching</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">
            Our engineers model your hourly factory load against site-specific wind speeds and solar irradiance data.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-6); position: relative;">
          <div style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-primary); position: absolute; top: 16px; right: 20px;">03</div>
          <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">🏗️</div>
          <h4 class="card__title" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">3. Turnkey Execution</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">
            Full EPC delivery including turbine erection, solar balance of plant, grid synchronization, and O&M.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Section 3: Who We Serve (Pan-India Scope) */}
  <section class="content-section fade-in" style="padding: var(--space-12) 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-section__header" style="text-align: left;">
        <span class="content-section__label">Pan-India Footprint</span>
        <h2 class="content-section__title">Who We Serve Across India</h2>
        <p class="content-section__text">We partner with high-bill Commercial, Industrial & MSME facilities in all major manufacturing belts.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-8); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
        <div class="grid-3" style="gap: var(--space-6);">
          <div>
            <h4 style="color: var(--color-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-base); margin-bottom: 8px;">Textile & Dyeing Mills</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin: 0;">Surat, Ahmedabad, Tirupur, Ludhiana</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 style="color: var(--color-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-base); margin-bottom: 8px;">Ceramics & Tiles Plants</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin: 0;">Morbi, Wankaner, Himmatnagar</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 style="color: var(--color-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-base); margin-bottom: 8px;">Chemical & Processing</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin: 0;">Ankleshwar, Vapi, Dahej, Maharashtra</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 style="color: var(--color-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-base); margin-bottom: 8px;">Food Processing Units</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin: 0;">Maharashtra, Punjab, Andhra Pradesh</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 style="color: var(--color-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-base); margin-bottom: 8px;">Cold Storage & Logistics</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin: 0;">Rajasthan, Haryana, Uttar Pradesh</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 style="color: var(--color-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-base); margin-bottom: 8px;">Engineering & Metal Units</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin: 0;">Tamil Nadu, Karnataka, Gujarat</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: var(--space-10);">
        <a href="/projects" class="btn btn--secondary btn--large">See Real Projects Across India →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* CTA Section */}
  <section class="cta-section fade-in">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-section__content">
        <h2 class="cta-section__title">Ready to evaluate captive wind or hybrid for your plant?</h2>
        <p class="cta-section__text">Share your monthly utility bill. Our engineering team will deliver a custom load profile analysis — free, zero obligation.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--large">
          Get Your Free Savings Analysis
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
</AppLayout>
